[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:Shopping Made Easy]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]
[00:10.68]Who was the thief? | 小偷是谁？
[00:14.65]People are not so honest as | 人们不再像以前
[00:16.81]they once were. | 那样诚实了。
[00:18.75]The temptation to steal is greater than | 偷窃的诱惑力比以往任何时候
[00:22.12]ever before--especially in large shops. | 都更强烈了——特别是在大商店里。
[00:27.03]A detective recently watched a well-dressed | 最近，一名侦探盯上了一位穿着考究的
[00:30.36]woman who always went into a large store | 妇女，她总是进入一家大商店，
[00:33.80]on Monday mornings. | 而且总在星期一上午。
[00:35.90]One Monday, | 有一个星期一，
[00:37.46]there were fewer people in the shop | 店里的人比平时少，
[00:39.71]than usual when the woman came in, | 当这位妇女进来时，
[00:43.52]so it was easier for the detective to watch her. | 侦探便比较容易监视她了。
[00:48.60]The woman first bought a few small articles. | 这位妇女先是买了几样小商品。
[00:52.98]After a little time, | 过了一会儿，
[00:54.95]she chose one of the most expensive dresses | 她挑了店里最昂贵的一件衣服，
[00:58.71]in the shop and handed it to an assistant | 把它递给一位售货员，
[01:02.41]who wrapped it up for her as quickly as possible. | 售货员以最快的速度为她包好了衣服。
[01:07.16]Then the woman simply took the parcel | 然后，那妇女只是拿过包裹
[01:10.94]and walked out of the shop without paying. | 没付钱就走出了商店。
[01:15.38]When she was arrested, | 当她被逮捕时，
[01:17.49]the detective found out that | 侦探发现
[01:19.49]the shop assistant was her daughter. | 原来那位售货员是她的女儿。
[01:23.02]The girl 'gave' her mother | 这姑娘“送给”她母亲
[01:25.33]a free dress once a week! | 每周一次免费的衣服！
